#NOTE:The 11 Taiwan routes removed on 2026-09-30 were restored because the revalidation incorrectly treated direct MPEG-TS responses as HLS manifests. Kodi remains untouched.
#NOTE:2026-10-08 naori-test 49 dead routes replaced with Haruka 118.69.27.222 mappings; all 49 ffprobe plus 6s A/V decode passed; terrestrial 46/46 rechecked.
#NOTE:2026-10-20 added 10 Taiwan public channels; master/child/current media segment revalidated. Dali uses the newest rolling segment because old entries expire.
#NOTE:2026-10-20 Taiwan adult direct-TS routes revalidated 11/11 with HTTP 200 and MPEG-TS sync at 188-byte intervals.
#NOTE:2026-10-20 corrected Taiwan port labels: 1022 is 奧視1 and 3031 is 奧視2; both direct MPEG-TS feeds revalidated.
#NOTE:2026-10-25 separated Taiwan port 3016 from 驚豔 EPG after a concurrent 60-second video-fingerprint comparison with port 85 produced zero strong matches.
#NOTE:2026-10-25 full ffprobe audit removed 101 non-decodable entries and 6 MyCamTV promotional feeds; F1 FAST was repaired to HTTPS.

#NOTE:2026-10-25 TV-safe Kodi edition excludes the adult group.
#NOTE:2026-10-25 restored 8 Tokyo terrestrial and 7 BS simulcasts from a new relay; each passed 12-second A/V decode and visual station identification. BS11/BS12 error-slate feeds were rejected.
#NOTE:2026-10-25 added verified official public NTV NEWS and MBS NEWS feeds; created 03 CS-specialist group and sorted all category prefixes numerically.
